1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,020
Our duty is to continue the struggle against imperialism.

2
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:08,560
Our duty is to continue to build our Grenada revolution

3
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:14,020
and ensure that we, as one Grenada people, small as we are,

4
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:19,220
will forge that wider, meaningfully, and will ensure the unity of our people.

5
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:21,660
Long live the Grenada revolution.

6
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:29,360
All power and glory to our people for whatever, for whatever, for whatever.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Thank you.

